# OpenSCAD: OpenSCAD User Manual, The OpenSCAD Language (2021.01); requirements/languages/openscad.md
name     openscad scad

keyword  module function include use if else for let each intersection_for assert echo
builtin  cube sphere cylinder polyhedron square circle polygon text translate rotate scale mirror
builtin  multmatrix color offset hull minkowski union difference intersection linear_extrude
builtin  rotate_extrude import surface projection render children true false undef PI len concat
builtin  lookup str sin cos tan abs sqrt pow min max floor ceil round

line-comment   //
block-comment  /* */
string   " "  : escapes
sigil    $    : meta
operators  +-*/%&|^!<>=:?~#
calls
